{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m1_1_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m1_1_cal",
 "I'm not a bad dream. I'm their worst nightmare."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m1_3_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m1_3_cal",
 "Now, where did all those gun-toting madmen get to?", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m1_4_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m1_4_cal",
 "Get ready for a surprise. Here's Caleb!", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m1_8_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m1_8_cal",
 "Eviction time!", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m3_2_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m3_2_cal",
 "They just don't make them like they used to."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m3_3_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m3_3_cal",
 "Hmm, I'll take a BLT. That's a lettuce, tomato, and blood sandwich. Hold the mayo, huh?", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m3_4_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m3_4_cal",
 "Ah, now that's a spicy meatball.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m4_1_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m4_1_cal",
 "Looks like there's killing to do."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m4_2_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m4_2_cal",
 "Ah, this place is a hellhole. Heh heh, I like it.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m4e3a_cal.wav", "dialogue.6caleb1",
 "These aren't Cabal."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m4e5a_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m4e5a_cal",
 "Hell if I know. What do you care? You don't seem to be having any problems with him."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m4e7a_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m4e7a_cal",
 "What's that supposed to mean?"},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m4e9a_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m4e9a_cal",
 "I will solve it!"},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m5_1_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m5_1_cal",
 "Hey, this place should be giving me kickbacks."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m5_3_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m5_3_cal",
 "Hmm, this is gonna get a lot worse before it gets better.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e1m5_5_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e1m5_5_cal",
 "Ugh. At least I'm not the only old dead guy down here.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e2m5_1_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e2m5_1_cal",
 "It's Howdy Doody time, kiddies. The bad man is here.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e2m5_2_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e2m5_2_cal",
 "Well, that's one way to open somebody up, but not nearly as quick or fun as my method."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e2m5_4_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e2m5_4_cal",
 "Ugh, I feel like a piece of meat.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m1_2_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m1_2_cal",
 "Now we're cooking with GAS!"},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m1_3_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m1_3_cal",
 "Ahhh, nothing's ever easy."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m2_1_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m2_1_cal",
 "What a waste of good ammunition!"},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m2_2_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m2_2_cal",
 "Hmm, a security checkpoint. Oh, damn. I guess I'm foiled. I'll have to turn back."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m2_3_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m2_3_cal",
 "Wow, with such spacious accommodations, perhaps I should seek employment here."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m3_1_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m3_1_cal",
 "Good morning, and in case I don't see you again, good afternoon, good evening, and good night!"},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m3_2_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m3_2_cal",
 "That's him. That's the man I'm looking for."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m3_3_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m3_3_cal",
 "I'm no mechanic. I just mostly hurt people. Going down."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m5_1_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m5_1_cal",
 "You know this place seems almost unreal."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m5_3_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m5_3_cal",
 "This bridge looks perfectly safe to cross."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/e3m5_4_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.e3m5_4_cal",
 "A fine example of typical Cabal construction."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/kill/c_1liner_2.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.kill.c_1liner_2",
 "Everybody dies."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msc11cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msc11cal",
 "I'd say I'm sorry, but you know it wouldn't be sincere. Have a nice day."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msc14_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msc14_cal",
 "Mmm, nothing like fresh-packed meat."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msc15_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msc15_cal",
 "Meat inspector. I'm afraid I'm gonna have to shut you down."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msc16_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msc16_cal",
 "Oh, what a mess. These conditions are hardly sanitary.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msc17_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msc17_cal",
 "Mmm, grape is my favorite. Yum!", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msc18_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msc18_cal",
 "Back to the grind..."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msccaleb1.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msccaleb1",
 "Locked.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/msccaleb2.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.msccaleb2",
 "It's stuck.", true},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/subbcaleb1.wav", "dialogue.8caleb1",
 "You've gotta be kidding."},
{"sounds/chosen/caleb/taunt/tnt5_cal.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.caleb.taunt.tnt5_cal",
 "Yeah, and I thought I was ugly."},
{"sounds/chosen/gabriella/e1m4e3_gab.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.gabriella.e1m4e3_gab",
 "Someone's got to hold the train. These things are everywhere out there. The Cabal must be pretty desperate "
 "to be creating such creatures."},
{"sounds/chosen/gabriella/e1m4e4_gab.wav", "dialogue.6gab2",
 "Then what are they?"},
{"sounds/chosen/gabriella/e1m4e6_gab.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.gabriella.e1m4e6_gab",
 "I don't have problems. I solve them."},
{"sounds/chosen/gabriella/e1m4e8_gab.wav", "dialogue.sounds.chosen.gabriella.e1m4e8_gab",
 "I'm not sure I can count on you anymore. This is becoming a bad situation. And if you can't solve it, I "
 "will."},
{"sounds/enemies/ancientone/ancient1.wav", "dialogue.17ish1",
 "Insect, we are the Ancient One.  Bow down before us."},
{"sounds/enemies/ancientone/ancient2.wav", "dialogue.17ish2",
 "You are all that stands between us and dominion?  Pathetic."},
{"sounds/enemies/ancientone/ancient3.wav", "dialogue.17ish3",
 "All that is will no longer be.  All that was has never been.  All that was to come... um..."},
{"sounds/enemies/ancientone/ancient4.wav", "dialogue.17ish4",
 "All that was to come will never... happen."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/02civ1.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.02civ1",
 "Hey, buddy, you all right? You look like hell."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/02civ3.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.02civ3",
 "Hey, I think the train is out. You know what? Maybe we should catch a cab."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/02civ4.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.02civ4",
 "You gonna bark all day little doggy or you gonna bite?"},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/02civ5.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.02civ5",
 "No weapons allowed in here, buddy! Unless you buy it for me."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/11civ2.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.11civ2",
 "Anything except hamburgers."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/11civ4.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.11civ4",
 "Yeah, I got a hot dog for you."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/12civ2.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.12civ2",
 "Oh, crap!"},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/12civ3.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.12civ3",
 "There's nobody home. Go away."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/12civ4.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.12civ4",
 "Leave me alone!"},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/12civ5.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.12civ5",
 "I don't want any!"},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/idle2.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.idle2",
 "This is not happening. This is not happening. This is not happening. This is not happening.", true},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/spot11.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.spot11",
 "Ah, shit. This is not my day."},
{"sounds/enemies/civilian/spot2.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.civilian.spot2",
 "This place is a madhouse!"},
{"sounds/enemies/f_civ/02civ2.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.f_civ.02civ2",
 "This can't be happening. I'm gonna be late for work!"},
{"sounds/enemies/f_civ/02civ8.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.f_civ.02civ8",
 "I don't know, I just stuck his head in too far, I guess."},
{"sounds/enemies/f_civ/09civ.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.f_civ.09civ",
 "Who is it?"},
{"sounds/enemies/f_civ/09civ3.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.f_civ.09civ3",
 "Really? Cool. I'm buzzing you in."},
{"sounds/enemies/f_civ/11civ1.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.f_civ.11civ1",
 "Man, all this gristle is making me hungry. What do you want for lunch?"},
{"sounds/enemies/f_civ/11civ3.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.f_civ.11civ3",
 "How about a hot dog?"},
{"sounds/enemies/f_civ/spot3.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.f_civ.spot3",
 "Everything's going to hell here! What is this?"},
{"sounds/enemies/gideon/15gid2b.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.gideon.15gid2b",
 "You have no idea how exquisite pain can feel. Allow me to demonstrate."},
{"sounds/enemies/gideon/tnt4_gid.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.gideon.tnt4_gid",
 "Today, I witness the fall of the Great Betrayer!"},
{"sounds/enemies/gideon/tnt7_gid.wav", "dialogue.sounds.enemies.gideon.tnt7_gid",
